    <item>
      <title>Calmon beta.20261126.0</title>
      <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:30:34 +0800</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>2611.26.0</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>beta.20261126.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown">## English

- Fixed an issue where clicking an app icon in the tab bar could switch back to the previous window if the selected app was slow to respond.

## 中文

- 修复点击标签栏中的应用图标后，应用响应较慢时可能切回原窗口的问题。</description>
