    <item>
      <title>Calmon beta.20261124.0</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 12:49:48 +0800</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>2611.24.0</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>beta.20261124.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown">## English

- Fixed Accessibility setup on macOS 27.3. Calmon opens System &amp; App Protection Override, where you can click + to add it.

## 中文

- 修复 macOS 27.3 上的辅助功能授权流程。Calmon 会打开系统设置里的权限面板，点击「+」即可添加。</description>
