    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Calmon beta.20261123.0</title>
      <pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 17:10:46 +0800</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>2611.23.0</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>beta.20261123.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown">## English

- Fixed a bug that could make Calmon jump back to the previous window after you clicked a window icon in the tab bar while the target window had an open dialog.

## 中文

- 修复目标窗口有弹窗时，点击标签栏图标切过去后可能跳回原窗口的问题。</description>
