    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Calmon beta.20261115.0</title>
      <pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 14:01:03 +0800</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>2611.15.0</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>beta.20261115.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown">## English

- Fixed new windows opened by another app losing focus to an older window in the same app stack.
- Background windows stay in the background, and your next window selection takes priority.

## 中文

- 修复由其他应用打开的新窗口加入同一应用窗口组后，焦点回到旧窗口的问题。
- 后台创建的窗口不会抢焦点，后续主动选择的窗口仍会优先聚焦。</description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/cxa/calmon/releases/download/vbeta.20261115.0/calmon-beta.20261115.0.dmg" length="10016738" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="WyG/O+QkaMRReQ+/PsyZJkh8eskyXURRgNpLC9dQPuUQgYrvGTKbsqKosS662kuZlQNEq+KYemVzssjOXUHmBw==" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Calmon beta.20261113.0</title>
      <pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 15:30:06 +0800</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>2611.13.0</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>beta.20261113.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown">## English

- Improved responsiveness when selecting window icons.
- Fixed some missed window selections when an app briefly stopped responding.

## 中文

- 改善点击窗口图标时的响应速度。
- 修复应用短暂无响应时，部分窗口选择请求未能完成的问题。</description>
